meta {
  name: Available Patient Lab Results
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/patients/:patientId/lab-results/available
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  patientId: {{patientId}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Gets all of the available lab result chemistries for the requested patient. Literal `|` separators are removed from these partner-facing display values. This endpoint can be used in conjunction with the `/patients/{patientId}/lab-results` endpoint to retrieve the available lab results for the patient.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `patientId` | Unique identifier of the patient. |

  ### Example response 200 OK

  ```json
  {
    "patientId": "16a20971-7771-5b5a-5a5a-075b18896114",
    "availableChemistries": [
      "ALPHA-1-GLOBULIN",
      "ALPHA-2-GLOBULIN"
    ]
  }
  ```
}
